\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Madrid protest reimagined by Tilla Martin.\
"Protests are a long-term run. The last 1000 meters protest is charged with the emotion and tension of the achievement of such a run. The reimagined Madrid protest is a composition of contrasted scapes : the dense atmosphere of the revolt versus the low, cyclical and everlasting rhythms of the Earth, when they don't both meet in intensity."\
